    },
    {
      "id": "e126",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 273,
      "y": 748,
      "width": 433.52165759830524,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786207753210,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Fill from the bottom. Static load lives in the plinth; a\ntop-heavy rack tips during a slide-out and fails seismic\nanchorage.",
      "originalText": "1. Fill from the bottom. Static load lives in the plinth; a top-heavy rack tips during a slide-out and fails seismic anchorage.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 36,
      "versionNonce": 264312070,
      "index": "b11",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e127",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 273,
      "y": 795,
      "width": 434.5277566562702,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786207753210,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Every unused U gets a blanking panel. An open U is a\nshort-circuit path that recirculates exhaust straight back\ninto the intake and can cost 2–5 degF at the top of the rack.",
      "originalText": "2. Every unused U gets a blanking panel. An open U is a short-circuit path that recirculates exhaust straight back into the intake and can cost 2–5 degF at the top of the rack.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 50,
      "versionNonce": 407578202,
      "index": "b12",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e128",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 273,
      "y": 845,
      "width": 432.01228102137725,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786207753210,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Patch field sits at 44–58\" AFF so a technician works\nstanding, hands between waist and shoulder. Never patch at\nankle height.",
      "originalText": "3. Patch field sits at 44–58\" AFF so a technician works standing, hands between waist and shoulder. Never patch at ankle height.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 45,
      "versionNonce": 1109689414,
      "index": "b13",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e129",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 273,
      "y": 890,
      "width": 436.5401205830949,
      "height": 30,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786207753210,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. Growth is reserved as contiguous U, not scattered gaps.\nScattered gaps cannot hold a 4U chassis later.",
      "originalText": "4. Growth is reserved as contiguous U, not scattered gaps. Scattered gaps cannot hold a 4U chassis later.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 61,
      "versionNonce": 1133071130,
      "index": "b14",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e130",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 273,
      "y": 925,
      "width": 436.5401205830949,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786207753210,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5. Side-to-side airflow switches (common in access switches)\nneed a duct kit or they ingest hot air from the neighboring\nrack.",
      "originalText": "5. Side-to-side airflow switches (common in access switches) need a duct kit or they ingest hot air from the neighboring rack.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 66,
      "versionNonce": 215485318,
      "index": "b15",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "autoResize": false
    },
